WEBVTT

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.170
Hey, how much longer are you gonna munch on that for?

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:52.720
The sun's setting already.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.570
Check it out.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.260
Something showed up.

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:24.130
Oh man.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.070
It'll be our first prey in a while.

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.580
Not very lively today, are we?

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:35.650
Let's go after it.

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.110
Though it is kinda big.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:50.910
Here.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.340
Yuki!

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:21.790
Morning.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:22.910
Morning.

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:25.220
Did you see the news?

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:25.960
Yeah.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.850
Another monster showed up.

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:29.540
They're blocking that area off for a while.

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:32.340
Wanna go have a quick look?

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.540
No way.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.130
Not like we could get close anyway.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.650
You think so?

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.310
You sure like that kind of stuff.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:46.980
There.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.770
So heavy...

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.430
Hey.

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:30.100
What are you doing?

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.880
This is my bike.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:38.780
Sorry.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.530
I hope you weren't planning on riding off with it.

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.450
Of course I wasn't.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:44.740
I wonder...

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:45.990
Wait!

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.170
I'm telling you, I wasn't.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:50.870
It just seemed like it was...

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.670
moving or something.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.750
Hey, let go.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:05.970
Huh?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.330
Ow!

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:15.980
Cenco!

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.710
A monster...

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:28.470
Kei!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.030
Oh, she's back.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.240
What?

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:40.510
Sorry, I need to go!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:40.510
Hey!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.630
Wait!

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.760
Tetsu Amamiya, and...

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:48.340
Cenco.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.010
Weird name.

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:52.230
Hey, listen.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:54.790
Don't tell anyone about this.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.270
It's a secret, huh?

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:59.150
So he can transform? Is he an alien?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.150
Secret.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.140
Is that big one a friend of his?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.390
Hey, are you listening?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.460
Don't feed him random stuff.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.420
Okay, sorry.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.520
See you.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:30.720
Don't tell anyone.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:37.660
Can you drive this?

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.140
I want a ride.

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.360
What?

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:44.260
If you let me, I promise I won't tell anyone.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.490
I'm back.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.460
I bought this.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.740
What is it?

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:00.630
Flan.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:02.130
Seriously?

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.890
I skipped out on cleaning to come here,
so I bought some for my friend.

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.260
And for you too.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.510
Here, hold them.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.600
I'll go get a spoon for you.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.760
I don't need it.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:20.770
You hungry?

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:23.520
Here.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.550
Man, why did she have to feed him something like that?

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.000
Hey there.

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:38.770
What do you want?

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:40.330
Did he see us?

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.260
That's a neat car you've got there.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.140
Isn't that a you-know-what?

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.970
You should hide that thing.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.600
Give me the car.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:58.470
Who are you?

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.270
I've already got my eye on one. I'll get to yours later.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.620
Do you now?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.780
That large one, right? I'll call it here for you.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.580
Pretty conspicuous, right?

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:12.240
I figured someone like you would go after it,
so I left it somewhere obvious.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:13.770
Huh?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:15.330
Might be a bit too far.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.730
Hello? Can you hear me?

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:18.500
You've got two of them?

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.790
What are you doing?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.350
Go hide somewhere.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:28.960
Huh? Where?

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:29.970
Doesn't matter where.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:31.220
Hey.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:33.110
Who's he?

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:36.110
Shut up. Go hide already, or you'll get hurt.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.650
Here, hold this.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:42.950
Cenco.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.360
What is that?

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.360
Shoot it down.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.230
Hey!

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.350
Idiot! Out of the way!

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.330
Dammit...

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:21.850
Cenco...

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:24.190
She's in the way.

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:25.330
What?

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.270
No, wait!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.870
It can transform?

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:56.050
Nice one he's got there.

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.610
Are you okay?

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:14.400
Yeah, I'm just a bit tired.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.210
Who was that just now? Someone you know?

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:19.230
None of your business.

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:22.100
Why are you being so rude? What about the flan?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.060
Beats me.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.580
And you put me in danger.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:31.380
Huh?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:32.620
What?

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.550
I'm going home.

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:38.200
I'll drive you there.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.100
It's fine.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.910
Thanks for giving me a ride.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.370
Thanks for saving me earlier.

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:51.040
Bye.

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:56.070
What were you thinking, letting her ride you?

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:14.730
Aw...

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.130
Maybe I should've gotten a lift after all.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.800
Guess I'll run.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.180
Hey.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.160
Don't run.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.810
Do you need something?

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:37.730
Where is he?

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.030
Don't ask me.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:42.450
Tell him this for me: "Let's hang out again."

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.410
What?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.980
Why me?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.800
Okay? Got it?

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:50.230
Y-Yes, I got it.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:54.880
You're just some rando, aren't you?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.630
How do you know him?

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:57.720
What?

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.050
We just met earlier today.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:07.520
Up we go.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.080
Where's a good place?

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.130
Well, whatever.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:15.530
Tell him to come to the top of that building tomorrow.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:17.650
All right?

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:19.510
Okay...

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:21.930
What's your name?

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.010
Yuki.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.250
That's why I said I'd drive you home.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.120
Yeah, I know...

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:41.390
What are you two doing?

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:44.390
Come on.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.250
I'll tell everyone about you.

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:48.580
Oh, shut up.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.950
Leave me alone.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.940
Do you really have to keep it a secret?

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.640
I'm here if you need someone to talk to.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:54.500
Gimme a break...

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:55.560
Huh?

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.350
What's your problem? Jeez.

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:02.460
Aren't you scared?

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.930
Here, want this? Here, here.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:07.330
Hey, I told you to stop that!

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.140
Huh? It's chocolate.

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:12.580
Stop feeding him random stuff. It affects his transformations.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.500
What a weird little guy.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:17.900
You're way weirder.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:20.380
So, what does he normally eat, then?

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:22.650
Hey.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.030
Remember that monster?

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:25.970
Yeah.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.750
He eats those.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.230
<i>That's</i> what he eats?

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.270
He'd die without food, you know.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:34.900
So...

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.290
Can I make him listen to what I say?

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.660
Not happening. You need one of these.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.110
You truant!

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.580
Kei!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.950
What? Am I interrupting something?

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.340
Not at all.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:58.010
Well, now you know.

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:00.060
I don't think you should go, though.

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:01.690
Let's go.

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.370
What's with that panda?

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:08.270
No idea.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.640
He sure has a lot of nerve.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:22.090
<i>Did she catch a cold or something?</i>

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.260
I'm glad you've calmed down.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.080
Why did you bring me here?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.520
You're a hostage.

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.270
They're quite busy down there.

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:40.590
Seems like they're here to remove this guy.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.020
I hope they shoot you down.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.750
Now then, let's disguise ourselves as one of the helicopters.

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.350
Were you able to turn into one?

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.020
Hey, are you listening?

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.490
You've been acting weird lately.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:03.190
What's wrong?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:13.990
What's your problem?!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:20.850
You jerk!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.450
Stay put for a bit.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.170
I'm looking out for that white one.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:28.230
You better not move around too much.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:29.820
You're kidding, right?

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.300
Huh? Really?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.560
Screw you!

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:39.310
They're here.

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:50.530
What are you doing here?

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.960
Don't miss.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.830
How did you climb up here?

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:11.820
Help me. He forced me to come with him.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:12.900
What? Who did?

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:13.390
Who do you—

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.020
Seriously?

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.950
Hey, Cenco.

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.120
You okay?

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:55.140
Hey, it's your time to shine!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.820
Let's wrap this up and get out of here!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.860
Hey, where's Amamiya?

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.760
I'll go get someone.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:40.960
Cenco...

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:51.170
Huh?

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.470
Oops-a-daisy.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:55.820
Hey!

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.790
You're alive, huh?

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:59.540
Things are looking bad out there.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.560
Let me rest for a bit.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.300
Wait, what happened to your arm?

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.050
Cenco ate it.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:08.920
He ate—

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:16.820
Ow.

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.030
Dammit.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.560
Cenco!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.520
Give me control!

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.850
Are you stupid? What do you think you can do?

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.650
You can barely stand.

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.150
I'll control him.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.610
I'm not giving him up.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.190
If we don't hurry up, he'll get eaten!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.080
Huh?

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:46.960
Cenco, you goddamn—

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.170
Dammit.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.450
You okay?

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.370
Great, he's been absorbed.

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:38.720
Nice, it worked.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.610
Maybe it's a bit too big.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.860
What? Something's pulling it?

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:00.740
Cenco?

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.480
What's going on?

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:03.230
Hey!

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:05.420
It's you, right?

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:06.100
Yeah.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.580
Let me in.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:10.490
Um, what's happening out there?

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.640
Hurry up!

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.130
Huh? Okay...

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.160
My control got stolen.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.830
There was still someone inside?

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.560
Hey, let's go.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.610
Where are you heading?

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.470
Hey!

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:38.650
What?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.920
Can't you make him a bit smaller?

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:41.990
You're too conspicuous.

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:44.610
Be quiet for a moment.

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:46.310
Be careful walking around.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.470
Crap.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.610
Hey! Protect yourself!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.070
Hurry up and let me in!

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:39.380
Hey there.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.260
So it was you.

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:46.170
Give me back control of the big guy.

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:47.220
Get out.

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:51.020
Stay still.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.670
Don't struggle.

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:56.310
Ow!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:59.070
Ouch! O-Ow!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.090
What?

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:02.030
That hurts! Ow!

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:17.960
Where the hell did she put me?

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.830
Cenco... Seriously?

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:31.870
Don't die on me.

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:49.240
Goddamn, my head hurts.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.090
Stop firing already.

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:54.990
Looks like it couldn't be fully absorbed due to the impact.

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.870
Let's get moving for now.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.490
Hey, what's wrong?

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.220
You can't undo the transformation?

00:22:19.260 --> 00:22:22.650
What do you mean, you can't change back?

00:22:23.180 --> 00:22:25.490
I brought him with me.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:32.030
Stay put.

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:33.820
Sorry.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:46.050
Well, I lost one. Guess it's time to retreat.

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:47.390
But before that...

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.470
He'll be fine, right?

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:14.110
Cenco,

00:23:14.670 --> 00:23:16.050
let's get out of here.

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:30.670
Come on, what are you doing?

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:04.400
Ouch...

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:10.300
It split open.

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:11.660
It sure did.

00:24:12.890 --> 00:24:15.300
Hey, show me your arm.

00:24:22.590 --> 00:24:24.520
You can keep him on.

00:24:24.880 --> 00:24:27.210
He'd memorized your arm.

00:24:37.330 --> 00:24:38.020
Hey...

00:24:38.020 --> 00:24:39.720
Don't move.

00:24:39.720 --> 00:24:41.390
How would you explain this?

00:24:45.680 --> 00:24:48.750
We don't want to get caught. Let's get out of here.

00:24:51.560 --> 00:24:53.840
You traitor.

00:24:55.170 --> 00:24:56.430
Come on.

00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:00.910
You can walk, right? Hurry up.

00:26:29.570 --> 00:26:30.430
Yeah?

00:26:30.430 --> 00:26:32.180
So? Did you find it?

00:26:32.180 --> 00:26:33.240
Yeah.

00:26:33.240 --> 00:26:34.940
It's moving along the coast.

00:26:34.940 --> 00:26:35.810
Really?

00:26:35.810 --> 00:26:38.390
All right. Please keep watch until I—

00:26:42.190 --> 00:26:44.450
Please don't make a move before I'm there.

00:26:44.450 --> 00:26:49.520
Uh... I think it might be diving into the ocean...

00:26:49.520 --> 00:26:51.000
I'll go ahead and stop it.

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:51.330
Wha—

00:26:53.230 --> 00:26:57.240
When will Gotoda stop treating me like an amateur?

00:26:58.510 --> 00:26:59.050
Let's go.

00:27:43.420 --> 00:27:47.220
Oh dear, what a mess.

00:27:47.220 --> 00:27:48.720
That was quick.

00:27:48.720 --> 00:27:50.890
Please give me a break.

00:27:50.890 --> 00:27:54.150
We're supposed to be taking them alive.
Why did you kill it?

00:27:54.150 --> 00:27:56.730
Not my fault, it wouldn't stay put.

00:27:58.010 --> 00:28:00.610
It didn't have an ability anyway.

00:28:05.410 --> 00:28:06.580
Sorry.

00:28:15.090 --> 00:28:16.810
Our next assignment.

00:28:16.810 --> 00:28:19.500
What? Another one?

00:28:19.500 --> 00:28:21.510
Let's rest here for a while.

00:28:22.100 --> 00:28:24.930
Make sure you have a look through it.

00:28:26.600 --> 00:28:27.260
Hey.

00:28:27.260 --> 00:28:27.970
Yes?

00:28:27.970 --> 00:28:28.960
It's Shu.

00:28:28.960 --> 00:28:29.690
Indeed.

00:28:29.690 --> 00:28:30.900
Oh, right.

00:28:30.900 --> 00:28:33.270
Were you keeping me out of the loop again?

00:28:34.170 --> 00:28:37.720
I <i>was</i> planning to tell you once we were done with this assignment.

00:28:37.720 --> 00:28:41.760
He went out to hunt without permission eight days ago, and never came back.

00:28:41.760 --> 00:28:42.570
And?

00:28:42.570 --> 00:28:45.250
The higher-ups seem to think he's betrayed us.

00:28:45.250 --> 00:28:46.530
Seriously?

00:28:46.850 --> 00:28:49.370
So they want us to find him and bring him back?

00:28:49.370 --> 00:28:50.390
Yes.

00:28:50.390 --> 00:28:52.760
At the very least, they want No. 41 back.

00:28:52.760 --> 00:28:56.190
Man, what a pain.

00:28:56.190 --> 00:28:58.330
Wait, how can you be so calm about this?

00:28:58.330 --> 00:29:00.160
Well, I found out two days ago.

00:29:00.160 --> 00:29:02.260
That's not what I mean...

00:29:02.260 --> 00:29:05.640
You're the best person for search missions like this.

00:29:05.640 --> 00:29:08.690
Not that it matters when it's Shu we're up against.

00:29:12.930 --> 00:29:14.780
He lost No. 74?!

00:29:14.780 --> 00:29:17.610
Yes, apparently he got into a fight with someone.

00:29:17.610 --> 00:29:20.410
I can't believe that idiot...

00:29:20.410 --> 00:29:22.700
It seems this is who he fought.

00:29:23.310 --> 00:29:24.610
Huh...

00:29:25.030 --> 00:29:26.130
He's pretty cute.

00:29:26.130 --> 00:29:26.690
Huh?

00:29:26.690 --> 00:29:27.960
What do we do with him?

00:29:27.960 --> 00:29:31.260
I haven't been told anything in particular.

00:29:40.840 --> 00:29:41.940
It's a bikini.

00:29:44.010 --> 00:29:46.650
Yay! The ocean!

00:30:01.140 --> 00:30:03.140
Got my work cut out for me on this one.

00:30:23.060 --> 00:30:23.870
You got it down?

00:30:23.870 --> 00:30:24.630
Yeah.

00:30:25.970 --> 00:30:27.880
Tetsu got it.

00:30:28.990 --> 00:30:31.090
Oh, thanks.

00:30:31.090 --> 00:30:32.310
You're welcome.

00:30:35.330 --> 00:30:36.460
Hey.

00:30:37.830 --> 00:30:41.900
Don't take your foul mood out on my friend.

00:30:42.670 --> 00:30:45.900
Stop using Cenco for dumb stuff like this.

00:30:46.430 --> 00:30:49.020
How should I be using him, then?

00:30:50.160 --> 00:30:53.800
You really can't give me back control of Cenco?

00:30:54.450 --> 00:30:56.950
Yeah, that's what I've been telling you.

00:30:57.920 --> 00:30:58.960
Oh?

00:31:02.200 --> 00:31:04.970
Huh? Where are you going? What about class?

00:31:04.970 --> 00:31:05.960
I'm skipping it.

00:31:05.960 --> 00:31:07.280
What?

00:31:22.140 --> 00:31:24.970
I really can't stand this smell.

00:31:24.970 --> 00:31:27.490
I'm amazed that it's not affecting you.

00:31:27.490 --> 00:31:29.690
You need to get used to this already.

00:31:29.690 --> 00:31:32.410
We've seen what we came for.
Let's hurry up and leave.

00:31:32.410 --> 00:31:34.660
We don't want anyone to spot us.

00:31:35.230 --> 00:31:36.990
Also, why the bad mood?

00:31:39.250 --> 00:31:41.660
The picture. Of the guy who did Shu in.

00:31:41.660 --> 00:31:43.620
Right, here you go.

00:32:00.730 --> 00:32:02.910
Found him. No luck with Shu.

00:32:02.910 --> 00:32:05.020
I doubt we'll find him.

00:32:11.500 --> 00:32:12.850
Miss?

00:32:13.870 --> 00:32:16.170
I'm gonna go check out that Tetsu kid.

00:32:16.170 --> 00:32:17.480
That's dangerous.

00:32:17.480 --> 00:32:20.230
We have no idea what kind of power he has.

00:32:20.230 --> 00:32:22.290
Don't worry, I'll be fine.

00:32:22.290 --> 00:32:25.200
Please don't make a mess again this time.

00:32:25.200 --> 00:32:26.870
You get hot-headed too easily.

00:32:26.870 --> 00:32:30.530
I know, I know. You don't need to be so fussy.

00:32:33.340 --> 00:32:34.460
Let's go.

00:32:58.170 --> 00:33:02.120
Hey, how long are you planning on staying with her?

00:33:02.570 --> 00:33:03.620
Dammit.

00:33:05.320 --> 00:33:08.000
I need to get him back already.

00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:08.840
Huh?

00:33:15.080 --> 00:33:17.250
Hey, is Amamiya here?

00:33:17.250 --> 00:33:19.430
Haven't seen him since lunch, actually.

00:33:20.040 --> 00:33:20.990
Okay...

00:33:22.890 --> 00:33:24.190
Cenco?

00:33:31.280 --> 00:33:32.930
Forgot my motion sickness pills...

00:33:32.930 --> 00:33:34.560
Not another one...

00:33:34.560 --> 00:33:36.070
Careful...

00:33:41.660 --> 00:33:43.620
Don't dodge!

00:33:42.450 --> 00:33:43.620
What do you want?!

00:33:44.020 --> 00:33:46.920
I heard you defeated Shu,

00:33:46.920 --> 00:33:48.210
but you seem pretty normal.

00:33:48.210 --> 00:33:49.630
Shu?

00:33:50.420 --> 00:33:51.880
That guy?

00:33:58.350 --> 00:33:59.800
What?

00:33:59.800 --> 00:34:01.460
Where's your kite?

00:34:01.460 --> 00:34:03.650
Isn't it with you?

00:34:03.650 --> 00:34:04.140
Kite?

00:34:09.360 --> 00:34:10.500
Gimme your arm for a sec.

00:34:10.500 --> 00:34:11.560
Stop it.

00:34:11.560 --> 00:34:13.150
You're hiding it? That's suspicious.

00:34:13.150 --> 00:34:13.990
Stay away!

00:34:13.990 --> 00:34:15.490
Come on, just let me see!

00:34:15.490 --> 00:34:16.320
Got you!

00:34:21.480 --> 00:34:22.680
Cenco?

00:34:29.420 --> 00:34:30.780
What are you doing?

00:34:30.780 --> 00:34:32.100
That's...

00:34:32.100 --> 00:34:34.240
Sorry, but could you go away?

00:34:34.240 --> 00:34:35.550
We're kind of busy.

00:34:35.550 --> 00:34:37.420
Busy?

00:34:43.000 --> 00:34:44.410
Another one.

00:34:45.660 --> 00:34:47.560
Get off me.

00:34:48.280 --> 00:34:49.260
That hurts!

00:34:49.260 --> 00:34:50.690
Get away from me.

00:34:51.560 --> 00:34:53.530
I'm not giving you Cenco.

00:34:56.780 --> 00:34:57.770
Hanpen.

00:35:04.290 --> 00:35:06.480
What? What's going on here?

00:35:06.480 --> 00:35:07.890
Get ready to run.

00:35:07.890 --> 00:35:09.170
You call it Cenco, huh?

00:35:09.670 --> 00:35:12.550
I've never seen one that attaches to your arm before.

00:35:13.290 --> 00:35:14.610
What do we do?

00:35:14.610 --> 00:35:17.880
I just came here to ask where Shu is...

00:35:20.820 --> 00:35:23.250
Okay, we'll capture him to be on the safe side.

00:35:24.260 --> 00:35:26.120
Give me a knife!

00:35:38.240 --> 00:35:39.200
Dammit.

00:35:39.200 --> 00:35:40.860
Give me projectiles!

00:35:40.860 --> 00:35:42.410
Projectiles?

00:35:46.850 --> 00:35:47.900
Give me a break.

00:35:47.900 --> 00:35:49.290
This isn't what I meant!

00:35:55.090 --> 00:35:55.840
Cenco!

00:36:02.930 --> 00:36:03.860
You there.

00:36:03.860 --> 00:36:04.590
Huh?

00:36:04.590 --> 00:36:05.940
What's your name?

00:36:05.940 --> 00:36:07.930
I'm... Yuki.

00:36:07.930 --> 00:36:09.980
Okay. I'm Kaname.

00:36:10.490 --> 00:36:12.970
So you're the one who was controlling that runt.

00:36:12.970 --> 00:36:15.020
You better not tell her anything.

00:36:16.940 --> 00:36:19.070
I'd like to know where Shu is.

00:36:19.420 --> 00:36:20.630
Who's Shu?

00:36:20.630 --> 00:36:23.570
He's the one who attacked us before.

00:36:23.570 --> 00:36:24.450
Oh...

00:36:24.450 --> 00:36:26.070
I wouldn't know.

00:36:26.070 --> 00:36:28.120
And you don't know either, do you?

00:36:28.120 --> 00:36:30.330
I don't. Also...

00:36:30.330 --> 00:36:34.090
Yuki, give me back control of Cenco already.

00:36:34.090 --> 00:36:34.950
Huh?

00:36:34.950 --> 00:36:37.450
Why would you give me a slingshot when I asked for projectiles?

00:36:37.450 --> 00:36:38.600
Isn't that what you wanted?

00:36:38.600 --> 00:36:41.240
It didn't even come with balls! At least give me ammo too!

00:36:41.240 --> 00:36:42.230
Quiet.

00:36:43.170 --> 00:36:47.350
He's too persistent to leave these two alone.

00:37:07.720 --> 00:37:09.140
Right...

00:37:10.030 --> 00:37:11.010
Right...

00:37:13.540 --> 00:37:14.750
Hey.

00:37:14.750 --> 00:37:16.630
Thanks for the other day.

00:37:16.630 --> 00:37:19.210
I didn't expect you to show yourself

00:37:19.210 --> 00:37:21.310
You're coming back with me, got it?

00:37:21.310 --> 00:37:22.880
Yeah, not happening.

00:37:23.390 --> 00:37:24.650
Really?

00:37:24.650 --> 00:37:28.470
Then I'd really love to know what you came here to do.

00:37:28.470 --> 00:37:30.230
You wanna duke it out with me?

00:37:34.560 --> 00:37:35.480
Come with me!

00:37:40.400 --> 00:37:42.860
You jerk! Let us go!

00:37:43.440 --> 00:37:44.650
See ya.

00:37:45.050 --> 00:37:47.440
You really think I'm letting you go?

00:37:47.440 --> 00:37:48.660
Do it!

00:37:58.880 --> 00:38:00.790
I seriously can't stand him.

00:38:13.640 --> 00:38:15.000
Ouch...

00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:17.140
It's pretty cramped with three in there.

00:38:17.810 --> 00:38:18.550
Hey.

00:38:19.150 --> 00:38:21.270
You're still around?

00:38:21.270 --> 00:38:24.040
Thanks to you two, I'm a wanted man.

00:38:24.040 --> 00:38:25.520
I don't have anywhere to go.

00:38:25.520 --> 00:38:26.860
Serves you right.

00:38:28.410 --> 00:38:29.890
You busy today?

00:38:29.890 --> 00:38:30.700
Huh?

00:38:30.700 --> 00:38:32.550
I thought I'd invite you for coffee.

00:38:32.550 --> 00:38:33.720
Huh?

00:38:36.500 --> 00:38:37.890
I slipped up.

00:38:37.890 --> 00:38:39.420
Don't beat yourself up.

00:38:39.420 --> 00:38:41.930
At least we got to confirm that Shu is here.

00:38:41.930 --> 00:38:44.170
Could you not mention his name?

00:38:44.170 --> 00:38:46.140
I get annoyed just hearing it.

00:38:48.680 --> 00:38:50.610
Oh yeah, that boy with the spiky hair...

00:38:50.610 --> 00:38:52.230
You mean Tetsu Amamiya?

00:38:52.230 --> 00:38:53.990
He didn't have a kite.

00:38:53.990 --> 00:38:54.690
What?

00:38:54.690 --> 00:38:56.890
The one controlling it was some other girl.

00:38:56.890 --> 00:38:59.110
So... In other words...

00:38:59.110 --> 00:39:01.970
That means your intel was wrong.

00:39:01.970 --> 00:39:02.970
Go file a complaint.

00:39:02.970 --> 00:39:04.070
What?

00:39:04.070 --> 00:39:07.050
I was so close to bringing the guy with me.

00:39:07.050 --> 00:39:08.070
Almost embarrassed myself.

00:39:08.070 --> 00:39:09.690
That's strange, though.

00:39:09.690 --> 00:39:12.770
That intel was pretty fresh.

00:39:12.770 --> 00:39:16.680
I'm sure Shu came here after seeing it too.

00:39:16.680 --> 00:39:20.040
Well, everyone makes mistakes.

00:39:20.040 --> 00:39:23.900
It didn't seem like they'd do anything if we left them alone, though.

00:39:23.900 --> 00:39:26.700
Plus, its only ability was transforming.

00:39:25.590 --> 00:39:28.110
Would you be able to find that girl?

00:39:28.110 --> 00:39:31.260
That idiot flew off with them, so no idea.

00:39:31.260 --> 00:39:32.460
And?

00:39:32.460 --> 00:39:33.220
Hm?

00:39:33.220 --> 00:39:35.410
What did you want to discuss?

00:39:37.680 --> 00:39:39.770
Before that, I have a question.

00:39:39.770 --> 00:39:40.910
You there...

00:39:41.790 --> 00:39:45.570
How did you steal control of No. 74?

00:39:45.570 --> 00:39:46.440
What?

00:39:49.050 --> 00:39:51.170
You mean that huge one?

00:39:51.170 --> 00:39:53.450
I didn't steal anything.

00:39:55.220 --> 00:39:56.800
All right,

00:39:56.800 --> 00:39:58.340
let's cut to the chase.

00:39:58.340 --> 00:40:00.250
What do you want?

00:40:00.250 --> 00:40:03.920
Let's work together to bring down Kaname.

00:40:06.900 --> 00:40:09.510
Is Kaname the four-eyes from—

00:40:08.770 --> 00:40:12.420
Why do we have to fight?

00:40:12.420 --> 00:40:14.050
Tetsu, let's go.

00:40:14.590 --> 00:40:17.210
What? Say something.

00:40:17.210 --> 00:40:21.850
Now that you've been marked by them,
you don't have any choice but to fight.

00:40:21.850 --> 00:40:24.310
You really plan on working with this guy?

00:40:24.310 --> 00:40:27.450
Are you fine with his right arm being taken away?

00:40:30.800 --> 00:40:33.760
You can discuss this between yourselves, then.

00:40:33.760 --> 00:40:36.200
I have no intention of fighting.

00:40:36.200 --> 00:40:37.060
I'm leaving.

00:40:37.620 --> 00:40:39.650
Why are guys always so...

00:40:39.650 --> 00:40:41.830
Be careful walking around outside.

00:40:41.830 --> 00:40:45.580
Better walk where you can't be seen, or they'll find you.

00:40:46.070 --> 00:40:46.920
Hey,

00:40:46.920 --> 00:40:50.280
do we really have a fighting chance against a monster like that?

00:40:51.760 --> 00:40:54.700
You'd have no chance going up against it alone.

00:40:54.700 --> 00:40:56.150
Not happening.

00:40:56.860 --> 00:40:58.890
That's why we need a plan.

00:41:01.770 --> 00:41:04.570
My four-legged guy out there

00:41:04.570 --> 00:41:08.650
has the ability to pull the link out from others.

00:41:08.650 --> 00:41:10.060
Link?

00:41:10.060 --> 00:41:14.840
The thing connecting your right arm and...
Wait, I guess you don't have it anymore.

00:41:14.840 --> 00:41:16.870
It's an invisible connection.

00:41:16.870 --> 00:41:19.900
I say "plan", but it's really simple.

00:41:19.900 --> 00:41:23.870
I need you to get Kaname's attention for a bit.

00:41:24.230 --> 00:41:27.400
I'll pull her link as soon as her guard is down.

00:41:27.400 --> 00:41:29.600
So you want us to act as bait?

00:41:29.600 --> 00:41:31.230
Essentially, yes.

00:41:31.230 --> 00:41:32.720
Link, huh...

00:41:33.630 --> 00:41:37.360
Once she's lost control of it,
the rest will be a walk in the park.

00:41:37.360 --> 00:41:39.760
So... Does that mean...

00:41:39.760 --> 00:41:40.400
Yeah?

00:41:40.400 --> 00:41:45.270
Could you take that link you pull and transfer it to, well...

00:41:45.270 --> 00:41:48.020
That's quite possible. Probably.

00:41:48.020 --> 00:41:50.520
Bait, you say...

00:41:50.990 --> 00:41:52.020
I have a condition.

00:41:52.020 --> 00:41:53.570
Sure, let's hear it.

00:41:55.460 --> 00:41:57.320
Let go of me, you...

00:41:58.860 --> 00:42:02.330
Would you keep still! Don't fight!

00:42:02.330 --> 00:42:05.680
I want out! Let me out!

00:42:05.680 --> 00:42:09.290
I'm not really a fan of this kind of thing.

00:42:11.160 --> 00:42:13.920
But she refused to get in the car!

00:42:13.920 --> 00:42:18.180
Remind me, who said that she'd
"let her guard down with another girl"?

00:42:18.750 --> 00:42:20.510
Whatever, just start driving already!

00:42:21.120 --> 00:42:22.510
Yeah, yeah.

00:42:32.020 --> 00:42:33.250
You calmed down?

00:42:33.820 --> 00:42:37.110
We were a bit forceful in bringing you here,
but we don't have much time.

00:42:37.110 --> 00:42:38.480
"A bit"?

00:42:38.480 --> 00:42:39.820
Now, now...

00:42:39.820 --> 00:42:42.250
For starters, let's introduce ourselves.

00:42:42.250 --> 00:42:43.880
My name is Gotoda.

00:42:43.880 --> 00:42:44.880
I'm Kaname.

00:42:46.170 --> 00:42:47.620
Yuki.

00:42:49.960 --> 00:42:53.960
Japan Dangerous Animal... Research?

00:42:54.650 --> 00:42:57.370
All over the world, you'll find drones—

00:42:57.370 --> 00:43:00.490
oh, I'm referring to those monsters—

00:43:00.490 --> 00:43:03.890
and our job is to investigate and manage them.

00:43:04.330 --> 00:43:08.310
We're particularly concerned with dangerous ones with abilities.

00:43:08.310 --> 00:43:11.610
We have to either capture them or dispose of them.

00:43:11.610 --> 00:43:13.570
So you're after Cenco.

00:43:13.570 --> 00:43:16.400
Cen... Oh, you means yours?

00:43:16.400 --> 00:43:19.700
No, we're here for a different reason.

00:43:19.700 --> 00:43:20.780
We're looking for Shu.

00:43:20.780 --> 00:43:24.660
I want you to meet with Shu again,
and then inform us of his location.

00:43:24.660 --> 00:43:25.850
What?

00:43:25.850 --> 00:43:28.320
I can't keep up with him.

00:43:28.320 --> 00:43:30.480
You know how he turns invisible.

00:43:30.480 --> 00:43:33.670
If possible, I'd like you to lure him out somewhere.

00:43:33.670 --> 00:43:36.930
Why do I have to do that?

00:43:36.930 --> 00:43:41.150
If you help us, we'll guarantee the safety of you two.

00:43:41.150 --> 00:43:43.350
And we'll let the boy keep his arm.

00:43:43.350 --> 00:43:45.230
This is low.

00:43:45.230 --> 00:43:46.100
Trust us.

00:43:47.470 --> 00:43:50.050
Once we've captured Shu, we'll leave this town,

00:43:50.050 --> 00:43:52.350
and we won't interfere with you.

00:43:52.350 --> 00:43:53.400
I promise.

00:43:53.400 --> 00:43:54.340
Please.

00:43:54.340 --> 00:43:55.760
He's dangerous.

00:43:58.220 --> 00:44:01.320
Fine, I'll contact you if I see him.

00:44:01.320 --> 00:44:03.590
Not like I have any reason to protect him.

00:44:03.590 --> 00:44:04.650
Really?

00:44:04.650 --> 00:44:05.830
Thank you.

00:44:05.830 --> 00:44:06.790
Your phone.

00:44:06.790 --> 00:44:07.400
Huh?

00:44:07.400 --> 00:44:09.820
How are you gonna contact us without my number?

00:44:09.820 --> 00:44:11.740
Oh... Right, yeah.

00:44:13.080 --> 00:44:14.410
So...

00:44:14.410 --> 00:44:17.230
This might sound like a strange question...

00:44:17.230 --> 00:44:17.840
What?

00:44:17.840 --> 00:44:21.390
It's about the one currently attached to you.

00:44:21.390 --> 00:44:23.440
Was it always yours?

00:44:23.440 --> 00:44:23.960
Huh?

00:44:23.960 --> 00:44:27.490
Well, I mean, was he originally that boy's...

00:44:27.490 --> 00:44:28.390
Yeah, that's right.

00:44:28.390 --> 00:44:29.040
What?

00:44:29.040 --> 00:44:31.740
He originally belonged to Tetsu.

00:44:31.740 --> 00:44:35.060
Somehow he ended up mine at some point.

00:44:33.690 --> 00:44:35.060
Here. Thank you.

00:44:35.060 --> 00:44:37.400
I'd like to discuss it with your friend too.

00:44:37.400 --> 00:44:38.020
Right.

00:44:38.020 --> 00:44:39.920
Do you think we could meet tomorrow?

00:44:39.920 --> 00:44:40.790
Sure.

00:44:40.790 --> 00:44:41.780
I'll tell him.

00:44:41.780 --> 00:44:42.490
Huh?

00:44:43.280 --> 00:44:44.170
What's wrong?

00:44:44.170 --> 00:44:45.280
Uh... Nothing...

00:44:45.280 --> 00:44:47.640
That's all you needed, right? I'll head back now.

00:44:47.640 --> 00:44:50.820
You want me to drop you off nearby? With No. 16.

00:44:51.330 --> 00:44:52.090
No!

00:44:53.320 --> 00:44:54.410
Gotoda?

00:44:54.410 --> 00:44:58.190
Uh, I mean, I'll drive her home with my car.

00:45:03.970 --> 00:45:05.890
That girl's a Twister.

00:45:05.890 --> 00:45:07.010
Twister?

00:45:07.010 --> 00:45:08.810
Never heard of them?

00:45:08.810 --> 00:45:12.020
They can forcibly take control of someone else's kite.

00:45:12.020 --> 00:45:14.850
Oh, so that's why you stopped me before.

00:45:14.850 --> 00:45:17.270
Nothing happened when we met this morning.

00:45:17.270 --> 00:45:18.350
Yeah...

00:45:18.350 --> 00:45:22.140
Maybe she didn't need to steal someone else's because she already had one...

00:45:22.140 --> 00:45:24.010
Or maybe she couldn't.

00:45:24.980 --> 00:45:27.530
So that Tetsu boy had his stolen.

00:45:27.530 --> 00:45:28.730
Poor kid.

00:45:28.730 --> 00:45:30.140
So, what do we do?

00:45:30.140 --> 00:45:31.960
Isn't it fine to just let her be?

00:45:31.960 --> 00:45:33.030
We'll recruit her.

00:45:33.030 --> 00:45:34.360
Really?

00:45:35.170 --> 00:45:36.170
Oh?

00:45:36.170 --> 00:45:37.860
Not interested?

00:45:37.860 --> 00:45:41.470
Weren't you the one going,
"I want friends my own age"?

00:45:41.470 --> 00:45:45.430
Well, you know, she's just so <i>normal</i>.
I don't know about her.

00:45:45.430 --> 00:45:48.810
Spiky hair boy seemed more useful than her.

00:45:48.810 --> 00:45:51.300
I don't plan on recruiting him.

00:45:53.610 --> 00:45:56.310
Also, maybe you've forgotten,

00:45:56.310 --> 00:45:58.560
but we're here to capture Shu.

00:45:58.560 --> 00:46:00.160
Yes, I know.

00:46:00.160 --> 00:46:02.600
But I wonder if he'll show up again.

00:46:03.570 --> 00:46:06.740
You know better than anyone what he's like.

00:46:06.740 --> 00:46:08.660
So, what?

00:46:08.660 --> 00:46:14.020
You want me to take back control of that Cenco of yours from that girl?

00:46:14.020 --> 00:46:15.140
Can you do it?

00:46:15.140 --> 00:46:16.290
Easy as pie.

00:46:16.290 --> 00:46:18.530
But man, that's nasty.

00:46:18.530 --> 00:46:20.230
Does the girl know about this?

00:46:20.230 --> 00:46:21.880
Keep your promise.

00:46:21.880 --> 00:46:24.050
Don't worry.

00:46:24.050 --> 00:46:27.440
I don't care about that right arm anymore.

00:46:27.440 --> 00:46:31.350
Once I get ahold of Kaname's,
I'll be too preoccupied to link to it anyway.

00:46:32.760 --> 00:46:38.270
Do you think it's a coincidence that yours and mine got taken over by that Yuki girl?

00:46:39.010 --> 00:46:40.870
Where did that come from?

00:46:40.870 --> 00:46:43.880
Well, it's got to be a coincidence, right?

00:46:45.250 --> 00:46:47.700
That Yuki girl...

00:46:48.210 --> 00:46:50.040
<i>Be careful around her.</i>

00:46:50.710 --> 00:46:52.210
So, yeah.

00:46:52.210 --> 00:46:54.830
They asked me to take you to see them.

00:46:55.220 --> 00:46:56.170
Are you listening?

00:46:56.170 --> 00:46:59.290
Yeah. Don't go deciding something like that without me.

00:46:59.290 --> 00:47:01.880
That's just how things ended up.

00:47:01.880 --> 00:47:03.910
They're the ones who said they wanted to meet, right?

00:47:03.910 --> 00:47:05.790
Huh? Yeah.

00:47:05.790 --> 00:47:07.880
You gonna help that glasses girl?

00:47:08.500 --> 00:47:09.190
Hm?

00:47:09.760 --> 00:47:11.210
Dunno.

00:47:11.210 --> 00:47:13.540
I'll decide when I meet her.

00:47:13.540 --> 00:47:14.310
Okay.

00:47:14.310 --> 00:47:16.420
What's a good time and place?

00:47:16.420 --> 00:47:18.310
I need to let them know.

00:47:18.310 --> 00:47:19.760
At night.

00:47:19.760 --> 00:47:21.650
Somewhere with no people around.

00:47:21.650 --> 00:47:23.160
Like where we fought Shu.

00:47:23.160 --> 00:47:24.400
What?

00:47:24.400 --> 00:47:25.640
Why there?

00:47:25.640 --> 00:47:27.630
It's easy to hide there,

00:47:27.630 --> 00:47:29.880
and it'll be hard for Kaname to spot him at night.

00:47:29.880 --> 00:47:31.850
No way, not that place.

00:47:31.850 --> 00:47:33.740
If she finds him, she'll be furious.

00:47:33.740 --> 00:47:35.840
If you're scared, we can go together.

00:47:37.410 --> 00:47:39.470
I won't come unless it's at night.

00:47:42.420 --> 00:47:44.070
You're hiding something.

00:47:44.070 --> 00:47:45.210
What?

00:47:45.210 --> 00:47:46.610
I'm not hiding anything.

00:47:46.610 --> 00:47:48.830
What did you talk to Shu about?

00:47:48.830 --> 00:47:51.510
Nothing special. Just him wanting help to drive them off.

00:47:51.510 --> 00:47:52.670
That all?

00:47:54.950 --> 00:47:55.640
Hey.

00:47:55.640 --> 00:47:58.860
Anyway, I'm only going under those conditions.

00:47:58.860 --> 00:48:00.810
You forgot your arm.

00:48:07.490 --> 00:48:11.630
You're absolutely sure you can't
give me back control of Cenco, right?

00:48:11.630 --> 00:48:12.540
Huh?

00:48:12.540 --> 00:48:13.660
Yeah.

00:48:15.160 --> 00:48:17.550
J-Just don't worry about the details.

00:48:18.040 --> 00:48:19.640
Leave it all to me.

00:48:20.110 --> 00:48:20.990
Okay.

00:48:30.720 --> 00:48:33.220
Why does it have to be so dark?

00:48:33.220 --> 00:48:34.590
Come on, let go already.

00:48:34.590 --> 00:48:37.750
But I can't see anything.

00:48:38.470 --> 00:48:40.580
Get a move on.

00:48:39.610 --> 00:48:41.520
Idiot, don't push—

00:48:41.520 --> 00:48:42.390
Oh...

00:48:43.470 --> 00:48:44.500
Sorry.

00:48:47.580 --> 00:48:49.110
What are you doing?

00:48:49.410 --> 00:48:50.090
Oh.

00:48:50.570 --> 00:48:51.910
Kaname.

00:48:51.910 --> 00:48:53.280
Hi there.

00:48:53.280 --> 00:48:54.800
I wonder if he's here.

00:48:54.800 --> 00:48:55.890
No idea.

00:48:55.890 --> 00:48:58.370
Sorry about going overboard yesterday.

00:48:58.370 --> 00:49:01.970
I figured I should talk things over with you. About Shu.

00:49:01.970 --> 00:49:04.260
If you want me to help you out,

00:49:04.260 --> 00:49:04.820
I refuse.

00:49:04.820 --> 00:49:05.460
What?

00:49:05.460 --> 00:49:08.040
I don't give a damn about your quarrel,

00:49:08.040 --> 00:49:10.110
and I don't plan on helping either side.

00:49:11.370 --> 00:49:13.840
Sounds like you want to continue where we left off yesterday.

00:49:13.840 --> 00:49:15.820
Seriously? Are you serious? Why?

00:49:15.820 --> 00:49:18.810
I want to keep cyclops over there still for a bit.

00:49:18.810 --> 00:49:21.600
On my signal, wrap it in rope or something.

00:49:21.950 --> 00:49:23.860
I want to see if we can capture it.

00:49:23.860 --> 00:49:25.650
That's impossible!

00:49:26.230 --> 00:49:27.310
Miss.

00:49:27.310 --> 00:49:30.280
I'm just making it easier for Shu to show up.

00:49:36.700 --> 00:49:40.620
You need to rough up people like him a bit
to get it through their thick heads.

00:49:40.620 --> 00:49:41.620
A weapon!

00:49:41.620 --> 00:49:42.750
Idiot.

00:49:50.150 --> 00:49:51.980
Get behind me.

00:49:52.670 --> 00:49:53.920
Dammit.

00:50:01.810 --> 00:50:03.140
Are you happy?

00:50:03.140 --> 00:50:05.770
Do as you're told now.

00:50:05.770 --> 00:50:07.100
Yuki!

00:50:19.990 --> 00:50:20.660
Now!

00:50:20.660 --> 00:50:21.680
Perfect...

00:50:31.710 --> 00:50:32.970
What just...

00:50:33.630 --> 00:50:34.920
So you showed up after all.

00:50:34.920 --> 00:50:36.170
Shu...

00:50:36.490 --> 00:50:39.290
Dude, if you can't hold it off, I'm out of here!

00:50:39.290 --> 00:50:40.350
Do your job!

00:50:40.350 --> 00:50:43.480
Could you explain what's going on here?

00:50:42.110 --> 00:50:43.480
Again.

00:50:43.480 --> 00:50:45.690
Make it harder and thinner this time.

00:50:46.170 --> 00:50:48.190
I'll explain everything later!

00:50:48.190 --> 00:50:49.350
Okay, whatever.

00:50:55.610 --> 00:50:57.860
You can try again, but it'll end up the same.

00:51:10.650 --> 00:51:11.420
Cenco!

00:51:23.180 --> 00:51:23.920
What's that?

00:51:23.920 --> 00:51:26.410
I tried wrapping him in something cloth-like.

00:51:26.410 --> 00:51:27.420
"Like"?

00:51:27.420 --> 00:51:29.270
Let's take this chance to run.

00:51:30.310 --> 00:51:32.400
No, wait.

00:51:35.900 --> 00:51:38.080
Come on, what are you doing?

00:51:38.080 --> 00:51:40.200
Hurry up and tear that thing apart!

00:51:40.600 --> 00:51:41.970
Ow, ow, ow...

00:51:41.970 --> 00:51:42.620
Huh?

00:52:09.600 --> 00:52:11.520
G-Give it back!

00:52:18.690 --> 00:52:20.450
Get back! We're retreating!

00:52:20.970 --> 00:52:21.790
Retr—

00:52:21.790 --> 00:52:23.450
No, I refuse to run!

00:52:26.490 --> 00:52:27.470
Hey.

00:52:27.470 --> 00:52:30.320
Still serving as her babysitter, are you?

00:52:30.320 --> 00:52:33.860
Do you have any idea what they'll do to you?

00:52:33.860 --> 00:52:35.170
Well, yeah.

00:52:35.170 --> 00:52:39.170
But I think you should be more worried about yourselves right now.

00:52:39.170 --> 00:52:42.680
Life isn't easy when you have such a failure of a little brother.

00:52:42.680 --> 00:52:45.100
I can imagine, big bro.

00:53:00.960 --> 00:53:02.530
No! Stop!

00:53:02.530 --> 00:53:05.100
Hey, that hurts!

00:53:09.780 --> 00:53:11.240
Die, you bastard!

00:53:11.240 --> 00:53:14.520
You always drop the ball at the last moment.

00:53:14.520 --> 00:53:17.270
Are you the only ones here?

00:53:17.270 --> 00:53:19.050
I-I wonder...

00:53:19.050 --> 00:53:20.760
So it's just you, then.

00:53:20.760 --> 00:53:23.060
Idiot! There are others here too!

00:53:23.060 --> 00:53:24.990
Nope, there aren't.

00:53:24.990 --> 00:53:27.450
Hey, shouldn't we help out?

00:53:27.450 --> 00:53:28.230
Help who?

00:53:28.230 --> 00:53:29.310
Kaname, who else?

00:53:29.980 --> 00:53:31.750
Hey, so...

00:53:31.750 --> 00:53:33.640
I've got something to tell you.

00:53:33.640 --> 00:53:35.470
What are you trying to do?

00:53:35.470 --> 00:53:35.910
Hm?

00:53:35.910 --> 00:53:39.070
I'm asking what you're trying to do,
leaving the institute!

00:53:40.030 --> 00:53:41.880
You-know-who will kill you.

00:53:41.880 --> 00:53:43.860
Yeah, maybe. But,

00:53:43.860 --> 00:53:46.120
now that I have this guy,

00:53:46.120 --> 00:53:48.160
I don't think it'll be that easy.

00:53:48.750 --> 00:53:52.600
Well, I'd hate for that geezer to actually show up,

00:53:52.600 --> 00:53:55.500
so I'll stop picking on you now.

00:53:55.990 --> 00:54:00.240
However, your other ability is annoying,
so I'm pulling it out.

00:54:00.240 --> 00:54:01.760
You're not getting away.

00:54:02.850 --> 00:54:03.850
What was that?

00:54:04.420 --> 00:54:08.390
You have something to tell me?
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:54:09.350 --> 00:54:10.360
Cenco?

00:54:10.360 --> 00:54:10.810
What?

00:54:14.660 --> 00:54:17.150
You can make that thing move?

00:54:17.150 --> 00:54:20.610
You pulling out the link, or it landing.

00:54:21.210 --> 00:54:22.730
I wonder which will be faster.

00:54:37.870 --> 00:54:38.730
Tetsu?

00:54:38.730 --> 00:54:41.870
He better not be breaking the deal now.

00:54:42.370 --> 00:54:43.130
Give me my arm!

00:54:43.130 --> 00:54:43.930
Huh?

00:54:46.450 --> 00:54:49.560
Seriously, explain what's going on already!

00:54:52.670 --> 00:54:54.190
Ow, ow, ow...

00:54:56.650 --> 00:54:57.890
Miss...

00:54:57.890 --> 00:55:00.400
You can't call it down here!

00:55:00.400 --> 00:55:01.860
Don't talk to me.

00:55:01.860 --> 00:55:02.920
I can't concentrate.

00:55:02.920 --> 00:55:04.730
It's a bad idea to bring it down here.

00:55:04.730 --> 00:55:07.000
You can't even control it properly yet.

00:55:07.570 --> 00:55:09.200
People will die!

00:55:09.770 --> 00:55:11.490
No, only one idiot.

00:55:21.260 --> 00:55:22.090
It's...

00:55:24.180 --> 00:55:25.590
It's huge.

00:55:29.300 --> 00:55:30.720
Are you kidding me?

00:55:30.720 --> 00:55:33.220
She's actually controlling it.

00:55:33.220 --> 00:55:36.610
It's night, so I don't think she'll find me,

00:55:36.610 --> 00:55:39.270
but I can't move with that here.

00:55:39.270 --> 00:55:40.620
Don't move.

00:55:42.110 --> 00:55:45.440
You shouldn't have chosen a place with no people around.

00:55:50.780 --> 00:55:53.950
I'm not letting Grandpa get involved.

00:55:56.950 --> 00:55:58.590
Komokuten,

00:55:58.590 --> 00:56:00.940
quietly open your arms.

00:56:10.980 --> 00:56:13.090
I thought it couldn't see us!

00:56:29.880 --> 00:56:30.700
Did you get him?

00:56:39.780 --> 00:56:41.080
Goddammit!

00:56:51.630 --> 00:56:53.640
Over there, huh?

00:56:53.640 --> 00:56:55.780
He's not dead, is he?

00:56:59.140 --> 00:57:00.220
Is she all right?

00:57:00.220 --> 00:57:00.980
Yes,

00:57:00.980 --> 00:57:03.150
she just passed out from exhaustion.

00:57:03.150 --> 00:57:05.580
I'm not sure what to say, but I...

00:57:05.580 --> 00:57:06.270
I'm sorry.

00:57:08.670 --> 00:57:10.900
This isn't your fault.

00:57:10.900 --> 00:57:15.140
She overestimated her abilities
and underestimated her enemy.

00:57:15.140 --> 00:57:17.960
This might be a good lesson for her.

00:57:17.960 --> 00:57:18.860
Right.

00:57:19.760 --> 00:57:22.710
This means Shu is over that way, right?

00:57:22.710 --> 00:57:23.470
Huh?

00:57:23.470 --> 00:57:25.810
I'll go fetch those two idiots.

00:57:25.810 --> 00:57:27.230
You wait here.

00:57:27.230 --> 00:57:28.290
What?

00:57:31.180 --> 00:57:33.510
It's just barely managing to float.

00:57:34.460 --> 00:57:38.010
But man, she was able to move that thing?

00:57:38.010 --> 00:57:40.100
What a monster.

00:57:42.690 --> 00:57:44.030
Time to go.

00:57:51.280 --> 00:57:54.610
What is it? I was just wondering where you disappeared to.

00:57:55.850 --> 00:57:57.450
I lost track of him.

00:57:58.950 --> 00:58:01.040
Is she dead?

00:58:01.040 --> 00:58:03.440
Idiot. She's alive.

00:58:03.440 --> 00:58:05.020
Oh, okay.

00:58:05.020 --> 00:58:07.040
Did you see another girl here?

00:58:07.930 --> 00:58:10.250
She ran after you and Shu...

00:58:10.750 --> 00:58:12.050
to bring you back.

00:58:12.900 --> 00:58:15.010
What the hell is she thinking?

00:58:15.010 --> 00:58:17.760
By the way, who exactly is that girl?

00:58:17.760 --> 00:58:20.220
That kite belonged to you, right?

00:58:20.220 --> 00:58:23.020
No one special. She just ended up with him for some reason.

00:58:24.100 --> 00:58:25.770
What is it?

00:58:26.090 --> 00:58:30.560
I was actually thinking about recruiting her.

00:58:30.560 --> 00:58:32.160
Would you like to come with her?

00:58:32.160 --> 00:58:33.360
What?

00:58:33.360 --> 00:58:36.140
I feel like she'd turn us down
if we just invited her.

00:58:36.670 --> 00:58:38.560
There's no way I'm joining.

00:58:39.030 --> 00:58:43.060
I think it would be a good place for kids like you, though.

00:58:43.060 --> 00:58:45.180
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

00:58:45.180 --> 00:58:46.370
Really?

00:58:47.970 --> 00:58:49.580
Why her?

00:58:52.120 --> 00:58:56.340
It was because of her power that your drone got taken.

00:58:56.340 --> 00:58:57.210
Huh?

00:59:00.050 --> 00:59:03.060
Fetching them is easier said than done...

00:59:03.060 --> 00:59:05.870
Come on, you dimwit. Pick up the phone, Tetsu.

00:59:08.660 --> 00:59:09.740
What are you doing here?

00:59:09.740 --> 00:59:11.240
That's...

00:59:11.880 --> 00:59:16.290
G-Give that cyclops back to Kaname!

00:59:16.290 --> 00:59:17.240
Huh? What?

00:59:20.010 --> 00:59:21.360
It was hiding right there.

00:59:21.360 --> 00:59:21.860
Hey!

00:59:21.860 --> 00:59:22.770
What?

00:59:22.770 --> 00:59:25.140
You came here to ask me to give it back?

00:59:25.140 --> 00:59:26.660
Th-That's right.

00:59:26.660 --> 00:59:28.750
You're pretty funny.

00:59:28.750 --> 00:59:30.630
Glare at me all you want, I'm not giving it back.

00:59:31.260 --> 00:59:32.250
Oh yeah,

00:59:32.250 --> 00:59:33.530
I just remembered.

00:59:33.530 --> 00:59:34.600
What?

00:59:36.290 --> 00:59:36.970
Huh?

00:59:37.840 --> 00:59:39.190
Wait, are you serious?

00:59:39.190 --> 00:59:41.230
Huh? Didn't your friend tell you?

00:59:41.230 --> 00:59:42.100
Tell me what?

00:59:42.100 --> 00:59:44.250
In return for helping me,

00:59:44.250 --> 00:59:46.720
he wanted me to pull out your link.

00:59:46.720 --> 00:59:47.640
Never mentioned it.

00:59:47.640 --> 00:59:50.780
Oh? Was I not supposed to say that?

00:59:50.780 --> 00:59:52.360
But, well...

00:59:52.360 --> 00:59:53.360
Um...

00:59:53.360 --> 00:59:54.610
There you have it.

00:59:54.610 --> 00:59:55.480
No way.

01:00:04.190 --> 01:00:05.160
Hey.

01:00:05.620 --> 01:00:07.680
What are you doing?

01:00:07.680 --> 01:00:08.580
Wait up!

01:00:08.580 --> 01:00:11.760
Give it some thought whether you want to join us!

01:00:15.330 --> 01:00:16.620
You're the worst!

01:00:16.620 --> 01:00:18.410
I'll get you for this!

01:00:18.410 --> 01:00:21.130
If he was here I'd give it to him...

01:00:21.130 --> 01:00:23.340
Whatever, he'll figure something out.

01:00:23.970 --> 01:00:26.690
I've fulfilled my promise.

01:00:29.310 --> 01:00:31.570
Save your complaints for him.

01:00:31.570 --> 01:00:33.480
I tried to talk him out of it.

01:00:39.240 --> 01:00:41.090
Well then...

01:00:41.090 --> 01:00:44.630
Better scram before Kaname recovers.

01:00:44.630 --> 01:00:45.120
No,

01:00:45.530 --> 01:00:48.500
going back and finishing her off would...

01:00:50.530 --> 01:00:51.790
Something's pulling on it?

01:00:52.120 --> 01:00:53.250
This feels like...

01:01:07.370 --> 01:01:08.260
Shake.

01:01:09.720 --> 01:01:10.940
A Twister?

01:01:13.770 --> 01:01:15.060
Th-That's unfair!

01:01:25.570 --> 01:01:28.370
I don't really get it, but it seems the tables have turned.

01:01:28.370 --> 01:01:30.580
You're coming with me to Kaname.

01:01:31.250 --> 01:01:32.940
I wholeheartedly refuse!

01:01:38.990 --> 01:01:40.150
Come on...

01:01:47.140 --> 01:01:49.310
Where are you going?

01:01:52.770 --> 01:01:55.310
Did you forget about me?

01:01:55.310 --> 01:01:57.650
Do they even have a memory?

01:02:02.480 --> 01:02:04.370
You want to get across here?

01:02:04.370 --> 01:02:05.480
Let's see...

01:02:07.120 --> 01:02:08.240
Yeah, that's not happening.

01:02:21.930 --> 01:02:24.090
What the hell do you think you're doing?

01:02:24.090 --> 01:02:25.910
Change of plans.

01:02:25.910 --> 01:02:27.680
I'm taking that runt.

01:02:27.680 --> 01:02:28.860
What?

01:02:28.860 --> 01:02:32.640
Your partner's quite the schemer.

01:02:42.440 --> 01:02:45.300
Don't get on my bad side.

01:02:45.300 --> 01:02:47.700
Just hand it over and...

01:03:26.590 --> 01:03:28.650
It's been a while.

01:03:31.320 --> 01:03:33.130
What?

01:03:33.130 --> 01:03:35.010
Did he get his link back?

01:03:46.300 --> 01:03:48.920
Well, I'm sure it'll work out.

01:04:10.390 --> 01:04:12.410
What are you trying to do?

01:04:15.700 --> 01:04:17.500
It's over.

01:04:30.880 --> 01:04:32.430
Hey! What the hell are you—

01:04:38.670 --> 01:04:40.560
Huh?

01:04:43.810 --> 01:04:45.020
Are you all right?

01:04:45.830 --> 01:04:47.360
What about Shu?

01:04:47.810 --> 01:04:50.910
No, never mind, don't say anything.
I just remembered.

01:04:51.700 --> 01:04:53.230
Sorry.

01:04:53.230 --> 01:04:55.510
I let him walk off with No. 16.

01:04:56.590 --> 01:04:59.580
Save the apologies for later.
For now, let's just get out of—

01:04:59.580 --> 01:05:00.330
Wait, what?

01:05:02.990 --> 01:05:04.720
Did Tetsu come back here?

01:05:06.130 --> 01:05:07.920
Why are you riding him?

01:05:07.920 --> 01:05:09.130
Get off!

01:05:09.670 --> 01:05:12.050
He's the one who started clinging to me.

01:05:12.050 --> 01:05:14.760
That may be what it seemed like to you, but...

01:05:14.760 --> 01:05:16.510
Y-You homewrecker!

01:05:16.510 --> 01:05:17.790
Miss, a word...

01:05:17.790 --> 01:05:18.790
What?!

01:05:18.790 --> 01:05:20.010
Come here.

01:05:20.010 --> 01:05:21.380
What do you want?

01:05:21.930 --> 01:05:24.260
She's a Twister, which means...

01:05:24.260 --> 01:05:25.310
You're too close.

01:05:25.310 --> 01:05:29.470
If we bring her with us, they might forgive you for letting Shu go.

01:05:35.950 --> 01:05:39.050
You were looking for this guy, right?

01:05:39.050 --> 01:05:41.120
Could you take him with you?

01:05:45.220 --> 01:05:46.580
You took him down?

01:05:46.580 --> 01:05:47.580
Yeah.

01:05:58.250 --> 01:05:59.870
This is...

01:05:59.870 --> 01:06:01.170
pretty lucky.

01:06:01.170 --> 01:06:02.730
That it is.

01:06:05.330 --> 01:06:07.860
Well, all's well that ends well! Good job!

01:06:11.370 --> 01:06:12.640
Um...

01:06:12.640 --> 01:06:15.370
What happened to Shu? Did he die?

01:06:15.370 --> 01:06:17.320
He's not dead, you idiot.

01:06:17.320 --> 01:06:21.030
Anyway, what are you planning on doing with this guy?

01:06:21.030 --> 01:06:22.720
You can't hide it.

01:06:23.290 --> 01:06:24.900
It's way too big.

01:06:24.900 --> 01:06:26.820
Yeah, good question...

01:06:26.820 --> 01:06:28.510
If you're having trouble...

01:06:29.000 --> 01:06:33.320
Would you mind letting us take care of this big one?

01:06:33.320 --> 01:06:35.130
I'm not joining you, okay?

01:06:35.130 --> 01:06:36.660
Joining them?

01:06:36.660 --> 01:06:39.510
Oh, I'll discuss that with you later.

01:06:39.870 --> 01:06:43.270
Living together with a kite of this size must be problematic.

01:06:43.270 --> 01:06:46.050
We can take it in and care for it,

01:06:46.050 --> 01:06:49.410
so would you be willing to meet with people from the institute?

01:06:49.410 --> 01:06:51.020
Sure.

01:06:51.330 --> 01:06:53.120
You're coming too, right?

01:06:52.300 --> 01:06:53.120
What?

01:06:53.120 --> 01:06:54.590
Me? Why?

01:06:54.590 --> 01:06:58.460
Didn't you have something you wanted to say to me?

01:07:00.510 --> 01:07:03.800
Isn't it better than getting into a fight over Cenco again?

01:07:07.210 --> 01:07:09.010
I'm just tagging along, okay?

01:07:09.010 --> 01:07:09.750
Sure.

01:07:17.090 --> 01:07:19.750
People are about to show up.

01:07:19.750 --> 01:07:21.640
We better get out of here.

01:07:28.310 --> 01:07:29.980
We'll contact you once things have calmed down.

01:07:29.980 --> 01:07:33.100
Please don't cause any trouble in the meantime.

01:07:33.100 --> 01:07:35.050
And make sure you hide that one somewhere.

01:07:35.050 --> 01:07:36.360
Okay.

01:07:37.370 --> 01:07:38.450
Okay, shall we go?

01:07:38.450 --> 01:07:38.820
Huh?

01:07:44.510 --> 01:07:46.730
Thank you, Kaname!

01:07:46.730 --> 01:07:47.960
I'll take good care of him!

01:07:47.960 --> 01:07:50.190
It's not like I gave him to you.

01:07:55.430 --> 01:07:57.570
Guess we'd better get back, too.

01:07:58.670 --> 01:08:00.000
Yeah.

01:08:01.610 --> 01:08:06.110
Oh man, I'm gonna have to make Grandpa give me a new one once we're back.

01:08:29.330 --> 01:08:31.290
Ouch...

01:08:31.770 --> 01:08:33.090
Hey...

01:08:32.320 --> 01:08:33.860
Oh, sorry.

01:08:37.250 --> 01:08:39.840
Where are we supposed to hide him?

01:08:40.220 --> 01:08:42.060
Just leave him on a mountain or something.

01:08:44.000 --> 01:08:46.210
I really do prefer Cenco.

01:08:46.210 --> 01:08:46.950
He's cute, too.

01:08:46.950 --> 01:08:49.330
Hey, stop that.

01:08:49.330 --> 01:08:52.440
Yeah, it seems I really can't remove the link myself.

01:08:53.050 --> 01:08:54.690
It's just like with Cenco.

01:08:55.170 --> 01:08:57.410
Are you really going to see them?

01:08:57.410 --> 01:08:59.820
Well, yeah. I did promise them.

01:09:01.450 --> 01:09:03.870
Protect me if things get dangerous.

01:09:03.870 --> 01:09:06.780
You don't need any protection with that thing around...

01:09:06.090 --> 01:09:06.780
Don't forget...

01:09:09.870 --> 01:09:12.270
You owe me one.

01:09:12.270 --> 01:09:13.940
I said I'm sorry.

01:09:13.940 --> 01:09:14.710
Right.

01:09:20.950 --> 01:09:26.410
I try saying "I love you"

01:09:27.250 --> 01:09:33.400
As I look into your eyes

01:09:33.400 --> 01:09:38.830
Trying to find the answer

01:09:39.570 --> 01:09:45.150
I gaze into your eyes

01:09:45.850 --> 01:09:50.060
Magic makes a miracle

01:09:50.060 --> 01:09:57.400
We'll make one happen tonight, together

01:09:58.400 --> 01:10:01.550
Hey look, the darkness ahead

01:10:01.550 --> 01:10:04.610
Is fading all at once

01:10:04.610 --> 01:10:07.340
I prayed for my wish to be fulfilled

01:10:07.340 --> 01:10:10.540
Hold my hand and don't let go, okay?

01:10:21.210 --> 01:10:23.730
Come on, look this way

01:10:35.340 --> 01:10:40.960
Unable to say "I love you"

01:10:41.570 --> 01:10:47.620
As I look into your eyes

01:10:47.620 --> 01:10:50.890
God, I know

01:10:50.890 --> 01:10:54.550
We'll have to say goodbye one day

01:10:54.550 --> 01:11:00.130
Everyone only gets one chance

01:11:00.130 --> 01:11:04.400
Magic makes a miracle

01:11:04.400 --> 01:11:11.780
I'll show you the light in the darkness

01:11:12.710 --> 01:11:15.850
I can see tears building

01:11:15.850 --> 01:11:18.930
Here, take my hand

01:11:18.930 --> 01:11:21.680
As if connecting two points

01:11:21.680 --> 01:11:24.890
So we can face anything that comes our way

01:11:35.610 --> 01:11:38.020
Gently on your cheek

01:11:49.680 --> 01:11:52.810
The stars are shining bright tonight

01:11:52.810 --> 01:11:55.810
And I'm here with you

01:11:55.810 --> 01:11:59.620
How do you feel about me?

01:12:00.370 --> 01:12:04.170
You're asking me? What about you?

01:12:05.200 --> 01:12:08.650
Um, I'm honestly not really sure what to say

01:12:08.650 --> 01:12:10.340
I wonder

01:12:10.990 --> 01:12:12.990
What? Don't give me that

01:12:12.990 --> 01:12:14.400
That's not an answer

01:12:14.400 --> 01:12:16.790
I love you

01:12:18.700 --> 01:12:21.620
Huh? What did you just say?

01:12:23.400 --> 01:12:24.930
Nothing

01:12:24.930 --> 01:12:26.010
You're lying

01:12:25.330 --> 01:12:26.490
No I'm not

01:12:26.490 --> 01:12:28.010
But I heard you

01:12:28.010 --> 01:12:29.590
Now that's odd

01:12:29.590 --> 01:12:31.050
No, I heard you

01:12:31.050 --> 01:12:33.840
Maybe you're imagining it?

01:12:33.840 --> 01:12:35.410
I heard you

01:12:34.630 --> 01:12:36.070
No you didn't

01:12:35.410 --> 01:12:36.070
I heard you

01:12:37.580 --> 01:12:38.690
Come on

01:12:38.100 --> 01:12:38.690
Say it

01:12:46.830 --> 01:12:49.940
The two of us, nothing alike

01:12:51.410 --> 01:12:54.530
Are becoming one

01:12:54.530 --> 01:12:55.010
Hey

01:12:55.010 --> 01:12:55.760
What?

01:13:19.340 --> 01:13:21.770
Gently on your cheek
